  "program": {
    "module": {
      "summary": "Finance Act 2013 s.99 — Annual Tax on Enveloped Dwellings (ATED) amount\nchargeable.\n\nFor a chargeable period (1 April to 31 March) a chargeable person holding\na single-dwelling interest with taxable value above £500,000 pays the\nannual chargeable amount from the s.99(4) band table. If in charge on\nday 1 of the period the full annual amount is due; otherwise pro-rated\nby N/Y where N is days from the entry day (inclusive) to period end and\nY is days in the period (s.99(6)). Rates below are the 2024-25 figures;\nbands revalue every five years (next 1 April 2027)."
    },
